# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Credentials and machine-local state — never commit these
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Runtime config, written next to the executable on first run. It holds the
# WxPusher app_token / uid: committing it would publish a working push
# credential. Delete the file to regenerate a default one.
config.toml

# Runtime language files, extracted next to the config on first run. The
# canonical copies live in src/lang/ and are embedded in the binary; these are
# just the user-editable copies. Root-anchored, so src/lang/ stays tracked.
/lang/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Build output
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# All binaries land here (see build.sh). The directory also holds the runtime
# config.toml from above.
Release/

# Names build_out() falls back to when the target exe is locked by a running
# instance (Windows lets you rename a running exe, it just won't let you
# overwrite it).
*.new
*.exe~
*_old.exe

# Any stray exe, e.g. from running `go build ./src` by hand — that produces a
# binary with no manifest and no icon, so it must not be published.
*.exe

# Build-time resource object: app.manifest + app.ico compiled by rsrc. build.sh
# generates it per build and deletes it on exit (including on Ctrl-C).
*.syso

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Local state and scratch space
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Journal-derived files, in case a journal directory ever sits inside the repo
Status.json
Cargo.json
ShipLocker.json
*_test_journal/

*.log

# Verification scaffolding: test scripts, screenshots, throwaway configs
.tmp_verify/

# Working notes for this project (assistant memory, not part of the source)
.workbuddy/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Editors / OS
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
*~
*.swp
.idea/
.vscode/
